\f0\b \cf2 \strokec3 3% simulated torque ripple
\f1\b0 \cf2 \strokec3  and 
\f0\b \cf2 \strokec3 IE5-level energy-efficiency performance in simulations
\f1\b0 \cf2 \strokec3 . Through optimized magnetic geometry and intelligent drive control, we aim to combine smooth positioning, reduced energy consumption and reliable operation.\
Without permanent magnets vulnerable to irreversible demagnetization from excessive heat or opposing magnetic fields, our design offers a durable solution for applications requiring frequent starts, controlled movement and long service life.\

\f0\b \cf2 \strokec3 Our mission is to redefine positioning motors through precision, energy efficiency, robust engineering and cost-effective manufacturing.
